{
  "title": "Slime Possesses the Potential to Be the Strongest: In My Second Life, I’ll Properly Face My Slime",
  "description": "In a world where one’s entire life is determined by contracts with magical beasts...\n\nZeke, a pauper who formed a contract with the weakest of them all—a [Slime]—lived a life filled with regret and scorn from those around him. He eventually grew old and met a despairing end… or so he thought, until he found himself regressed to his childhood!\n\nDetermined to give [Fios]—the only partner he truly connected with in his previous life—a better fate this time, Zeke resolves to turn his life around.\n\nAiming to rise from a slum cleaner to the head of a grand merchant association, he sets his sights on the slime’s \"ability to dissolve anything.\" What’s more, it seems his slime partner also possesses a hidden power…?\n\nThis is a miraculous \"relife\" fantasy, where the regressed, weakest duo will dissolve the darkness of their world!",
  "artist": "Osafune Ouji",
  "author": "Inugata Dai",
